WEBVTT

1
00:00:21,010 --> 00:00:22,970
Finally returned to Stone Forest, Boss Lin

2
00:00:22,970 --> 00:00:24,330
Take a look at the photos to guide you

3
00:00:24,330 --> 00:00:35,440
What's wrong

4
00:00:35,440 --> 00:00:39,150
The photos I sent before are stored in my phone but

5
00:00:39,150 --> 00:00:41,950
The phone is out of battery. Boss Lin is thinking of a way.

6
00:00:41,950 --> 00:00:43,950
What should we do now? There is no way out.

7
00:00:43,950 --> 00:00:45,470
I can only rely on the remaining memories in my mind

8
00:00:45,470 --> 00:00:46,950
Entering the Stone Forest Maze Ding Hard

9
00:00:46,950 --> 00:00:48,550
How much time is left between the two champions?

10
00:00:48,550 --> 00:00:50,230
If you go out within three days, it won't be a big problem

11
00:00:50,230 --> 00:00:52,070
The poison attacks the heart for more than ten days

12
00:00:52,070 --> 00:00:55,740
The warrior will be completely and permanently disabled for three days.

13
00:00:55,740 --> 00:00:56,980
Then hurry up and set off
